[ti:Full of Mistakes]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.31]Lesson 105 | 第105课
[00:03.45]Full of mistakes | 错误百出
[00:07.08]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:13.49]What was Sandra's present? | 桑德拉的礼物是什么?
[00:18.33]Where's Sandra, Bob? | 鲍勃,桑德拉在哪里?
[00:20.63]I want her. | 我想找她。
[00:23.41]Do you want to speak to her? | 你想和她说话吗?
[00:27.38]Yes, I do. | 是的,我想。
[00:29.62]I want her to come to my office. | 我想让她到我办公室来。
[00:33.42]Tell her to come at once. | 让她马上来。
[00:37.22]Did you want to see me? | 你想见我吗?
[00:40.65]Ah, yes, Sandra. | 啊,是的,桑德拉。
[00:43.71]How do you spell 'intelligent'? | 'intelligent'怎么拼?
[00:47.26]Can you tell me? | 你能告诉我吗?
[00:49.61]I-N-T-E-L-L-I-G-E-N-T. | I-N-T-E-L-L-I-G-E-N-T。
[01:00.83]That's right. | 对的。
[01:02.79]You've typed it with only one 'L'. | 你只打了一个'L'。
[01:06.75]This letter's full of mistakes. | 这封信错误百出。
[01:10.65]I want you to type it again. | 我想让你重新打一遍。
[01:14.89]Yes, I'll do that. | 好的,我会做的。
[01:17.61]I'm sorry about that. | 对此我很抱歉。
[01:20.43]And here's a little present for you. | 这是给你的一点小礼物。
[01:23.78]What is it? | 是什么?
[01:25.48]It's a dictionary. | 是一本词典。
[01:27.61]I hope it'll help you. | 我希望它能帮到你。